# A TCModel game, written down move by move.
#
# Lines that are not comments are commands, exactly as they are typed at the
# prompt. Undo and redo are moves like any other, so reading this file back
# retraces the game as it was really played - second thoughts and all - and
# arrives at the same position it was saved from.
#
#   dotnet run -- replay <this file>

deal 2 639215091636143910

#   1  turn 1, Player 1
march b 9 11 2
#      Player 1 marches 2 Blue stone(s) from Windgap into Ironford.

#   2  turn 2, Player 2
march b 7 4 1
#      Player 2 marches 1 Blue stone(s) from Stonecradle into Thornwood.

#   3  turn 3, Player 1
battle b 12
#      Player 1 battles Dunmoor with a Blue stone, driving 1 Red back to the reserve.

#   4  turn 4, Player 2
resign
#      The game is over: the players walked away.
